<http://data.silknow.org/object/191beb1e-9258-35c5-97b4-c0049ef31ba4/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Stays of cream silk taffeta lined with silk, and bound and laced with matching ribbon. Short waisted, with square tabs at the hips, a low square neck and shoulder straps which tie at the back. It is laced with matching ribbon down part of the front and there are stitched eyelet holes for a laced back fastening. At the hips are more eyelet holes, possibly for the attachment of hip pads. Bones on the centre front and back have been removed."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/191beb1e-9258-35c5-97b4-c0049ef31ba4> .

